# TypeScript Code Style

## Type Safety
- ❌ **NEVER** use `any` - dùng `unknown` nếu chưa biết type
- ❌ **NEVER** use `@ts-ignore` - fix triệt để hoặc dùng `@ts-expect-error` với lý do rõ ràng
- ✅ Always define interfaces/types cho function parameters và return values
- ✅ Use `import type` cho type-only imports
- ✅ Enable `strict` mode in tsconfig

## Type Patterns
```typescript
// ✅ GOOD: Discriminated unions
type Result<T> = { success: true; data: T } | { success: false; error: string };

// ✅ GOOD: Generic constraints
function getById<T extends { id: string }>(items: T[], id: string): T | undefined

// ✅ GOOD: Branded types for IDs
type UserId = string & { __brand: 'UserId' };

// ❌ BAD: any
function process(data: any) { ... }

// ❌ BAD: optional chaining abuse
user?.profile?.settings?.theme?.color?.toString()
```

## Naming
- Interfaces: `IUser` hoặc `User` (chọn 1 convention, dùng `User`)
- Types: `User`, `CreateUserDTO`, `UserResponse`
- Enums: PascalCase keys, hoặc dùng `as const` thay vì enum
- Constants: `UPPER_SNAKE_CASE`

## Imports
- Group imports: external → internal → types
- Use named imports thay vì default
- Avoid barrel files (`index.ts`) trừ khi cần thiết

```typescript
// ✅ GOOD
import { Request, Response } from 'express';
import { prisma } from '@/config/database';
import type { User } from '@e-clone/shared/types';
```

## Async/Await
- Always use `async/await` thay vì `.then()` chains
- Always handle errors với `try/catch` hoặc error middleware
- Use `Promise.all()` cho parallel operations

## Functions
- Keep functions small (< 50 lines)
- Single responsibility
- Prefer pure functions
- Use destructuring for parameters

```typescript
// ✅ GOOD
function createUser({ email, name, password }: CreateUserDTO): Promise<User> { ... }

// ❌ BAD
function createUser(email: string, name: string, password: string): Promise<User> { ... }
```

## Comments
- ❌ Don't narrate what code does (`// increment i`)
- ✅ Explain **why** not what
- ✅ JSDoc for public APIs
- ✅ TODO comments must have owner: `// TODO(username): ...`
